[INFO|base_episode_generator.py:176:275] 2026-10-26 20:21:31,618 >> Okay, so I have this problem where I need to find the units digit of the sum 1! + 2! + 3! + ... + 2006!. Hmm, units digit... that's the last digit of the number when it's written out. So, I need to figure out what the last digit is when you add up all these factorials from 1! to 2006!.
