[INFO|base_episode_generator.py:176:275] 2026-10-26 20:23:38,693 >> \[f(x) + 2f \left( \frac{1}{x} \right) = 3x.\]Find the real solutions to $f(x) = f(-x).$  Enter the real solutions, separated by commas.<｜Assistant｜><think>
