[INFO|base_episode_generator.py:178:275] 2026-10-26 20:23:38,694 >> Wait, actually, Equation 2a is B + 2A = 3/x, which is the same as 2A + B = 3/x.
[INFO|base_episode_generator.py:178:275] 2026-10-26 20:23:38,694 >> 
[INFO|base_episode_generator.py:178:275] 2026-10-26 20:23:38,694 >> So, the system is:
