[INFO|base_episode_generator.py:178:275] 2026-10-26 20:23:38,694 >> 
[INFO|base_episode_generator.py:178:275] 2026-10-26 20:23:38,694 >> I need to solve for A (which is f(x)) and B (which is f(1/x)).
