[INFO|base_episode_generator.py:176:3287] 2026-10-26 20:28:21,037 >> Subtracting this from the current dividend:
[INFO|base_episode_generator.py:176:3287] 2026-10-26 20:28:21,037 >> \(-3x^3 -32x^2 -60x +47\) minus \((-3x^3 -21x^2 +15x)\)
[INFO|base_episode_generator.py:176:3287] 2026-10-26 20:28:21,037 >> Compute term by term:
[INFO|base_episode_generator.py:176:3287] 2026-10-26 20:28:21,037 >> - \(-3x^3 - (-3x^3) = 0\)
[INFO|base_episode_generator.py:176:3287] 2026-10-26 20:28:21,037 >> - \(-32x^2 - (-21x^2) = -11x^2\)
