[INFO|base_episode_generator.py:178:3287] 2026-10-26 20:32:42,564 >> 
[INFO|base_episode_generator.py:178:3287] 2026-10-26 20:32:42,564 >> Now, I can subtract these fractions. To subtract 1/2 from 7/8, I need a common denominator. 8 is the common denominator, right? So 1/2 is equal to 4/8. Subtracting 4/8 from 7/8 gives 3/8. So,
