[INFO|base_episode_generator.py:178:3287] 2026-10-26 20:32:42,564 >> 
[INFO|base_episode_generator.py:178:3287] 2026-10-26 20:32:42,564 >> Let me compute that. 12 divided by 3 is 4, and 4 multiplied by 8 is 32. So, x equals 32.
